		"description": "<p>(1/encounter) <strong>Free Action.</strong> A target of your choice in Range 6 is inspired. Their attack inflicts Blinded on hit for 1 minute or until they make a STR save on their turn.</p><hr><p><em>[A] The 1/encounter use is a counter on this feature. The targeted ally gets a mark: their next attack that hits Blinds its target (the Blinded effect asks for a STR save at the end of each of its turns).</em></p><p><em>[M] The 1-minute limit on Blinded is not tracked: remove it by hand.</em></p>",
